(This QoreRollup contract implements a post-quantum safe rollup using ML-DSA signatures and Merkle proofs. It) Tj
T* (demonstrates strong quantum resistance through multiple layers of protection including chain-gated windows,) Tj
T* (contract-verified keys, and verified batch signatures. However, it has significant operational risks due to its reliance) Tj
T* (on a single sequencer with no key rotation mechanism, and contains potential reentrancy vulnerabilities in the) Tj
T* (withdrawal process. The contract also lacks portability due to its dependency on chain-specific precompiles.) Tj
